WEBVTT

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:01.576
during rehearsal,

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:03.656
I was told that there had been

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:06.920
two to three recent TED Talks
about Black Lives Matter.

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:11.456
That maybe I should cut down my TED Talk

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:14.080
so it could "just" be
about Reproductive Justice.

00:04:15.280 --> 00:04:17.656
But that poem and this talk

00:04:17.680 --> 00:04:20.760
is fundamentally about
my inability to separate the two.

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:23.136
I was 21 years old --

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:30.160
(Applause)